{
  "version": 1,
  "language": "punjabi",
  "chapter": 45,
  "title": "Reading — Labels, a Form, and the Same Facts as Sentences",
  "drivablePrefix": 0,
  "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:3a41364c29036727",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "PA-C45-labels",
      "sequence": 2580,
      "title": "(reading) (merā nāṁ aman hai. merā kamm naukarī hai.) (nāṁ · umar · kamm · rihāiś · bhāśā · foun) (nāṁ: aman · umar: 25 · kamm: naukarī) — six labels, no blank after them",
      "headword": "(reading)",
      "romanization": "nāṁ · umar · kamm · rihāiś · bhāśā · foun",
      "gloss": "six form labels read cold - the first time the book asks you to read one rather than to fill it in",
      "script": "gurmukhi",
      "modality": "sight",
      "derivedModality": "sight",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "sight-cue"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:bef752a0b4df452b",
      "notice": {
        "modality": "sight",
        "needs": [
          "your eyes, because the lesson points at something written down"
        ],
        "waitUntilStopped": [],
        "text": "Before we start: this one needs your eyes, so it is not fully a driving lesson. You will want your eyes, because the lesson points at something written down. You can listen to all of it now and come back to the parts that need looking at once you have stopped."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You have written every one of these into a form. Not one is new."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is new is that there is no blank after it, and nothing telling you which is coming."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "comprehension",
          "title": "Reading",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਨਾਂ ਉਮਰ ਕੰਮ ਰਿਹਾਇਸ਼ ਭਾਸ਼ਾ ਫ਼ੋਨ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Read down the list once. Do not assemble each one letter by letter — look at the whole word and let it arrive."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Again, and notice which came at once and which you had to build. Both are fine. The difference is what practice removes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Filling a form, the label is the part you can ignore. It sits there, you know what goes next to it, and your attention is on the blank."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Reading one, the label is the whole message. ਰਿਹਾਇਸ਼ on its own tells you what a stranger is about to be asked."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "That is why six is enough for one sitting: the same six signs, doing the opposite job."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "the six labels down the list, once, without stopping",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: the six labels down the list, once, without stopping]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "repeat",
              "times": 2,
              "source": "[REPEAT x2]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "id": "PA-C45-labels-work",
              "prompt": "Which label asks what you do?",
              "assesses": [
                "PA-SKILL-READ-LABELS"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 12,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "kamm",
                "ਕੰਮ",
                "work"
              ],
              "feedback": {
                "correct": "ਕੰਮ.",
                "incorrect": "ਕੰਮ -- work."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "How many of the six were new? (None.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What was new? (There was no blank, and nobody said them first.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PA-C45-form",
      "sequence": 2590,
      "title": "(reading) (merā nāṁ aman hai. merā kamm naukarī hai.) (nāṁ · umar · kamm · rihāiś · bhāśā · foun) (nāṁ: aman · umar: 25 · kamm: naukarī) — a form somebody else filled in",
      "headword": "(reading)",
      "romanization": "nāṁ: aman · umar: 25 · kamm: naukarī",
      "gloss": "somebody else's finished form - six labels with six values already in them",
      "script": "gurmukhi",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:ba354345a50c2b83",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The last lesson gave you the labels alone. Here each one has an answer beside it."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Every value below is one you have written yourself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "comprehension",
          "title": "Reading",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਨਾਂ: ਅਮਨ ਉਮਰ: ੨੫ ਕੰਮ: ਨੌਕਰੀ ਰਿਹਾਇਸ਼: ਸ਼ਹਿਰ ਭਾਸ਼ਾ: ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਫ਼ੋਨ: ੦੧੨ ੨੫੧."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Read it through once, without stopping."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Now answer without looking back: what does this person do?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A form is the first real thing a beginner can read end to end, because it is built to be read fast and gives you the label before the value every time."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Notice the colon does the work a verb would do in a sentence. There is no ਹੈ anywhere on this page, and nothing is missing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Six lines, and you now know six things about somebody you have never met."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "the six lines, once, in order, without stopping",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: the six lines, once, in order, without stopping]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "repeat",
              "times": 2,
              "source": "[REPEAT x2]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "id": "PA-C45-form-work",
              "prompt": "What does Aman do?",
              "assesses": [
                "PA-SKILL-READ-FORM"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 13,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "naukari",
                "ਨੌਕਰੀ",
                "a job"
              ],
              "feedback": {
                "correct": "ਕੰਮ: ਨੌਕਰੀ.",
                "incorrect": "ਨੌਕਰੀ -- a job."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Whose form is this? (ਅਮਨ.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Which word does the colon replace? (ਹੈ — and nothing is missing without it.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PA-C45-pehla-paath",
      "sequence": 2600,
      "title": "(reading) (merā nāṁ aman hai. merā kamm naukarī hai.) (nāṁ · umar · kamm · rihāiś · bhāśā · foun) (nāṁ: aman · umar: 25 · kamm: naukarī) — the same six facts, as sentences",
      "headword": "(reading)",
      "romanization": "merā nāṁ aman hai. merā kamm naukarī hai.",
      "gloss": "the same six facts as sentences - forty-three words of Punjabi in a row, and not one of them new",
      "script": "gurmukhi",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:58beb19a93135601",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Six labels, then six lines of a form. Now the same person, in sentences."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Forty-three words, and not one of them is new."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "comprehension",
          "title": "Reading",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਮੇਰਾ ਨਾਂ ਅਮਨ ਹੈ। ਮੇਰਾ ਕੰਮ ਨੌਕਰੀ ਹੈ। ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦਾ ਹਾਂ। ਮੈਂ ਸੋਚਦਾ ਹਾਂ ਕਿ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਚੰਗਾ ਹੈ। ਮਨਨ ਮੇਰਾ ਦੋਸਤ ਹੈ। ਮਨਨ ਦਾ ਕੰਮ ਖੇਤੀ ਹੈ। ਮਨਨ ਠੀਕ-ਠਾਕ ਹੈ। ਪਰ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਤਾ ਕਿ ਉਹ ਕਿੱਥੇ ਹੈ। ਅਸੀਂ ਜਲਦੀ ਮਿਲਾਂਗੇ। ਧੰਨਵਾਦ।."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Read it once without stopping. Do not translate as you go — let the sentences arrive."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Now read it again, and notice how little work it took."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The form said the same things in six lines with no verb anywhere. Here ਹੈ has to be said out loud, and it comes last every time."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਕਿ hangs a whole sentence off another one. ਪਰ turns the paragraph. And after ਮਨਨ is named twice, he becomes ਉਹ — you followed that without being asked to."
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "This is the first whole paragraph the book has asked you to hold at once, and it works because every piece was paid for."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "the paragraph aloud, once, without stopping",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: the paragraph aloud, once, without stopping]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "repeat",
              "times": 2,
              "source": "[REPEAT x2]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "id": "PA-C45-pehla-paath-friend",
              "prompt": "What is the friend's work?",
              "assesses": [
                "PA-SKILL-CONNECTED-READING"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 14,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "kheti",
                "ਖੇਤੀ",
                "farming"
              ],
              "feedback": {
                "correct": "ਮਨਨ ਦਾ ਕੰਮ ਖੇਤੀ ਹੈ।",
                "incorrect": "ਖੇਤੀ -- farming."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "How many words in that paragraph were new? (None.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does the form leave out that the paragraph has to say? (ਹੈ.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "findings": []
}
